u next wear it."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Should I leave the chronograph running all the time?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "It does no immediate harm, but it adds wear and shortens the power reserve on a mechanical watch. Run it when you are timing something and stop it afterwards."}}]}]}</script>
